    <h1>About Foreign Immigration Services</h1>

    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services is a privately operated Philippine immigration consultancy, accredited by the Bureau of Immigration as an Accredited Consultancy.</p>

    <h2>Mission</h2>
    <p>We help individuals, families and organisations navigate immigration matters in the Philippines with clarity and confidence, from initial enquiry through to resolution.</p>

    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <p>Our practice covers four core areas — Visa and Immigration Applications, Extensions and Compliance, Residency and Long-Term Status, and Corporate and Global Mobility — alongside a range of specialised services for specific immigration situations. See our <a href="/services/">full range of services</a>.</p>

    <h2>Our Approach</h2>
    <p>Immigration matters can carry significant personal, professional and commercial consequences. Our approach is centred on careful assessment, clear communication and responsible handling of each engagement.</p>
    <p>We work with individuals, families and organisations to understand their circumstances, identify the appropriate immigration process and coordinate the documentary and procedural requirements relevant to their request. Client information is handled with discretion, and engagements are managed through the firm's official channels.</p>

    <h2>Accreditation</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services is a Bureau of Immigration Accredited Consultancy, Accreditation No. {{ site.accreditation.number }}. Read more on our <a href="/accreditation/">Accreditation page</a>.</p>

    <h2>How to Reach Us</h2>
    <p>The direct way to reach Foreign Immigration Services is by email at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. See our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for more information.</p>
